🚫 No Remote DB Syncing: Sensitive password profiles, private keys, and data states stay strictly on the machine. They are completely isolated from outside networks and never upload to a web server.🛡️ Local Machine Login Injection: When an app or website requests authorization, Immux-OS uses a local security prompt loop to match entries against an encrypted credential vault on your machine, instead of trusting an online host database. External sites only receive data if you explicitly click to grant access.